{"id":"en_the-lady-from-the-northeast-season-2","title":"The Lady from the Northeast Season 2","titleEn":"The Lady from the Northeast Season 2","description":"Leah Foster, whose blunt Northeastern character is impossible to ignore, is set to marry Kyle Preston, heir to Malaysia's wealthiest family. What began as a pretend romance between them has grown into something genuine. Thanks to her fearless and quick-witted nature, the once-divided Preston household has rediscovered its warmth. As the couple prepares for their wedding, Leah also manages to track down Kyle's brother, who had been missing for years. Through her own distinctive approach, she draws the family back together and secures her standing among them. The series and its episodes can be followed on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-lady-from-the-northeast-season-2/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-lady-from-the-northeast-season-2/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Sweet","Contract Marriage","Love After Marriage","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d5ehi/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-lady-from-the-northeast-season-2_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d5ehi/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-lady-from-the-northeast-season-2_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d5ehi/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-lady-from-the-northeast-season-2_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d5ehi/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable